WEBVTT

00:06:58.561 --> 00:07:02.069
So how might platforms
bring people together

00:07:02.093 --> 00:07:03.887
in a way that creates meaning

00:07:03.911 --> 00:07:06.236
and helps people understand each other?

00:07:06.680 --> 00:07:09.510
And this brings me back
to our friend from Burning Man.

00:07:10.545 --> 00:07:12.696
Because listening to him, I realized:

00:07:12.720 --> 00:07:15.767
it's not just that Burning Man
isn't the solution --

00:07:15.791 --> 00:07:19.053
it's actually a perfect metaphor
for the problem.

00:07:19.077 --> 00:07:20.426
(Laughter)

00:07:20.450 --> 00:07:22.760
You know, it's a great place
to visit for a week,

00:07:22.784 --> 00:07:26.672
this amazing art city,
rising out of nowhere in the dust.

00:07:27.387 --> 00:07:29.115
But you wouldn't want to live there.

00:07:29.139 --> 00:07:30.178
(Laughter)